The gods decreed a mysterious law: each moon, the villages would swap positions across the valley. When your village stood by the Offering River, you could pour in silver coins, which would flow downstream and transform—multiplying threefold by the time they reached the other village. When you stood by the River of Return, you received these multiplied riches but faced a choice: how much would you send back upstream?

